Get worker by a filter. 
    The filter should be a dictionary with key-value pairs that correspond to the fields in the worker table.
    Returns a JSON object with the worker data.

    If top is not specified, it will ALWAYS defaults to 20 records.

    Each filter field can accept either a single value or an array of values. When an array is provided, the filter applies an OR condition across all values in the array.

    For example:
    - {"FirstName": ["Josh", "Joshua"], "OrganizationUnitDescription": ["SPE", "Software Product Engineering"], "top": "100"} 
      This will find workers with first name Josh OR Joshua AND who are in SPE OR Software Product Engineering.

    DATE FILTERING SUPPORT:
    HireDate and ReHireDate fields support three filtering options:
    1. Exact date: {"HireDate": "2025-10-22"}
    2. List of dates: {"HireDate": ["2025-10-01", "2025-10-15", "2025-10-22"]}
    3. Date range: {"HireDate": {"from": "2025-07-22", "to": "2025-10-22"}}
       You can also use just "from" or just "to": {"HireDate": {"from": "2025-07-22"}}

    If you want to identify person/people based on their org unit, use OrganizationUnitDescription key for the search.

    This tool can handle searches with multiple word names, such as "Jason Grant Rossi" or "Rohit Singh Rana" if passed as:
    {"LastName": "Grant Rossi", "FirstName": "Jason"} or {"LastName": "Rana", "FirstName": "Rohit Singh"}.

    SORTING SUPPORT:
    You can sort results using the 'orderby' parameter as an OData orderby string:
    Examples: {"orderby": "HireDate desc"} or {"orderby": "HireDate desc, FirstName asc"}

    Input example: {"LastName": "Thompson", "top": "100"}
    Alternative input example: {"LastName": ["Thompson", "Thomson"], "FirstName": ["John", "Johnny"], "top": "100"}
    Date range example: {"HireDate": {"from": "2025-07-22", "to": "2025-10-22"}}
    Sorting example: {"OrganizationUnitDescription": ["SPE", "Software Product Engineering"], "orderby": "HireDate desc", "top": "5"}
    Output example: [{"GlobalId": 614160, "SystemLogonId": "A614160", "LastName": "Thompson", "FirstName": "E.", "MiddleName": "Alan", "InternetEmailAddress": "THOMPSON_E_ALAN@LILLY.COM", "PersonnelAreaDescription": "US: Indianapolis IN Corporate Center", "WorkCountryCode": "US", "SupervisorFirstName": "Bonny", "SupervisorLastName": "Rouleau-Mccabe", "SupervisorEmail": "rouleau_bonny_jean@lilly.com"}, {"GlobalId": 3033851, "SystemLogonId": "L033851", "LastName": "Thompson", "FirstName": "Kojo", "MiddleName": null, "InternetEmailAddress": null, "PersonnelAreaDescription": "US: Indianapolis IN Corporate Center", "WorkCountryCode": "US", "SupervisorFirstName": "Jeffrey", "SupervisorLastName": "Wagner", "SupervisorEmail": "wagner_jeffrey_r@lilly.com"}]

